title: "Synchrony backwards: recovering who is coupled to whom from rhythms alone"
abstract: "Kuramoto simulations showing that synchrony makes the inverse problem ill-conditioned, sparse regression for recovering network links, and an analysis of resting EEG from 109 volunteers using the imaginary part of coherency."
